{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51043","headline":"酬刘侍御过草堂 · 吴筠","name":"酬刘侍御过草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弱冠涉儒黑，壮怀归道真。\n栖迟高颍闲，得与巢由邻。\n豺狼乱天纪，流荡江海滨。\n江海非吾土，所赖吾同人。\n筑堂依绝巘，闭关从隐沦。\n一过嚣纷境，卧病逾三旬。\n皇灵垂矜恤，正气澄心神。\n但感适起居，何堦答苍旻。\n策羸返岩壑，情抱豁已伸。\n霜候变林薄，不能改松筠。\n弥见摄生理，邈然超世尘。\n写怀简同志，终古无缁磷。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}